{"id": "EUVD-2026-83208", "enisaUuid": "3e6707ad-f965-346a-b7b9-d3ab9ebf51d2", "description": "Icinga 2 is an open source monitoring system. From 2.8 until 2.14.9, 2.15.4, and 2.16.2, certificate update JSON-RPC message handling does not validate that the sender is a trusted endpoint. An unauthenticated network attacker able to connect to TCP port 5665 can replace the node certificate and trusted CA certificate, impersonate a trusted node, and take control of the node. This issue is fixed in versions 2.14.9, 2.15.4, and 2.16.2.", "datePublished": "2026-09-18T17:21:18", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-21T20:49:08", "baseScore": 9.8, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H", "references": ["https://github.com/Icinga/icinga2/security/advisories/GHSA-vj39-ww8j-vvx5", "https://github.com/Icinga/icinga2/pull/10907", "https://github.com/Icinga/icinga2/commit/4b7fb3405f4616a24b2b55e20f603a56b7dd6ad0", "https://github.com/Icinga/icinga2/commit/6c2e0db3819f859910a4ae265461cb51b1d2039c", "https://github.com/Icinga/icinga2/commit/a6f7cc7a4ef8beed023b24416106822d6940c4c0", "https://github.com/Icinga/icinga2/commit/d37b0cfd7d9595ae2f02fadb3d724c98d8620f81", "https://github.com/Icinga/icinga2/releases/tag/v2.14.9", "https://github.com/Icinga/icinga2/releases/tag/v2.15.4", "https://github.com/Icinga/icinga2/releases/tag/v2.16.2", "https://icinga.com/blog/icinga2-security-release-v2-16-2"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-61550"], "assigner": "GitHub_M", "epss": 0.67, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "2712054c-1fa9-3640-acbb-648d30d9aed1", "product": {"name": "icinga2", "vendor": {"name": "Icinga"}}, "product_version": "2.16.0, < 2.16.2"}, {"id": "5dfbc882-debb-3b41-a60e-a17ae75b402a", "product": {"name": "icinga2", "vendor": {"name": "Icinga"}}, "product_version": "2.15.0, < 2.15.4"}, {"id": "8c885c44-14f9-30dd-9a59-7f0c9cef4ae9", "product": {"name": "icinga2", "vendor": {"name": "Icinga"}}, "product_version": "2.8, < 2.14.9"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "